cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research companion, cite it using the metadata below.
  This record describes the package, not an accepted or published journal article.
type: software
title: >-
  Linear Residual Boosting for Rotor-Temperature Estimation in
  Permanent-Magnet Synchronous Motors: Accuracy, Initialization,
  and Computational Cost
authors:
  - family-names: Jo
    given-names: Minsu
  - family-names: Yoo
    given-names: Namhyun
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Beomseok
  - family-names: Choi
