version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-11-16'
abstract: >-
  Historical scientific source and saved-result verification materials for
  a conditional assessment of linear residual boosting, input-filter
  initialization, and measured scalar computational cost in permanent-magnet
  synchronous motor rotor-temperature estimation. All evaluated records
  were previously exposed. This package does not certify standalone
  retraining, timing reproduction, or independent confirmation.
keywords:
  - filter initialization
  - gradient boosting
  - inference latency
  - permanent-magnet synchronous motor
  - residual learning
  - rotor temperature
